# A1/A1.2/A1_16_jobs_and_workplaces.letz
# Source: PDF slide deck "L7 a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 7)
# (m)/(f)/(pl) markers stripped; (formal)/(informal) qualifiers stripped.
# Matching exercises ("Kombinéiert", "Wat maache si?", "Op eng Annonce reagéieren")
# resolved to their answer-key order and reproduced as completed sentences.
# "Receptionist"/"Receptionistin" corrected to LOD-verified "Receptionnist"/"Receptionnistin".
# Fills added: 18 @fill blocks drilling workplace prepositions (an/op/bei),
# the "als" pattern, verb conjugation (verkafen, schneiden), "well" + verb-final,
# and "vu Beruff". 4 new sentences mined from the homework dialogues (Part 2).

@lesson A1.16 "Jobs & Workplaces"

# --- Talking about your job ---
@word d'Erfarung = the experience
@word d'Annonce = the advertisement
@word d'Plaz = the position
@word fräi = free

# --- Professions (masculine / feminine) ---
@word de Sportler = the sportsman
@word d'Sportlerin = the sportswoman

@word de Botzmann = the cleaning man
@word d'Botzfra = the cleaning woman

@word de Kach = the chef
