@word den Zänndokter = the dentist
@word d'Zänndoktesch = the female dentist

@word de Sekretär = the secretary
@word d'Sekretärin = the female secretary

@word den Direkter = the director
@word d'Direktesch = the female director

@word de Mecanicien = the mechanic
@word d'Mecanicienne = the female mechanic

@word den Employé = the employee
@word d'Employée = the female employee

@word de Coiffeur = the hairdresser
@word d'Coiffeuse = the female hairdresser

@word de Receptionnist = the receptionist
